  "description": "Image uploads with SkiaSharp: format detection by magic bytes (PNG, JPEG, WebP; HEIC recognized and refused; PDF), a stream that stops at a size limit, and re-encoding to upright, metadata-free sRGB WebP in several sizes or to JPEG on white. No support: built for my own projects and shared as is; issues and pull requests aren't monitored, and any release may change or break things.",
